JACL Adventure Creation Language v4.0

For a quick-start look at some of the games included with this distribution,
change into the 'bin' directory and type, for example: 
'garjacl ..\projects\grail.jacl'

For instructions and installation information see the appropriate chapter
in the Author's Guide (guide/installation.html).

VS Code syntax highlighting
----------------------------

To install the JACL extension for Visual Studio Code:

    code --install-extension editors\vscode-jacl\jacl-0.1.0.vsix
